  "scope": "Exact Linux ARM64 and x64 OCI images under local Docker. The packaged Node worker and browser run on the macOS ARM64 host. The x64 server runs under emulation. The two Node reference controls and six combined Rust product runs cover browser discovery, opaque import, GitHub link, retained checkout and offline workspace removal, plus an approved initial commit and real Git push to a disposable local bare remote.",
